# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# Serve index.html (HTTP 200, no redirect) for any path that is not a real static
# file, so client-side routes and magic-link callbacks resolve instead of 404ing
# with Cloudflare's "nothing here yet" page.
#
# NOTE: this is the correct rule for Cloudflare *Pages* (`wrangler pages deploy`).
# It is safe now because the Workers deploy path (`wrangler deploy` / wrangler.jsonc)
# was removed — that path rejected this rule as an infinite loop (error 100324).
/*    /index.html    200
